he represents

3005
01:26:30,720 --> 01:26:32,120
the hero inside us.

3006
01:26:32,560 --> 01:26:33,640
Maybe someone realized

3007
01:26:33,640 --> 01:26:35,120
Loading had always helped him.

3008
01:26:35,120 --> 01:26:36,440
(Theory 2: The victim was grateful)
So he used Loading's name

3009
01:26:36,440 --> 01:26:37,740
(and took the blame for him)
and took the fall.

3010
01:26:37,820 --> 01:26:38,900
(Is this really
multiple personality disorder?)

3011
01:26:38,900 --> 01:26:40,060
(Who is Loading?)

3012
01:26:40,060 --> 01:26:43,100
(And who died in the real world?)

3013
01:26:43,260 --> 01:26:46,820
(Are the players different
personalities split from Loading?)

3014
01:27:04,360 --> 01:27:06,320
(Next episode preview)
A new memory space has been created.

3015
01:27:06,320 --> 01:27:07,440
(Multiple worlds, one truth)
Whose could it be?

3016
01:27:08,520 --> 01:27:09,240
Wait.

3017
01:27:09,240 --> 01:27:10,360
It changed to 222.

3018
01:27:10,360 --> 01:27:11,440
It was 111 before.

3019
01:27:11,440 --> 01:27:13,320
How are you any different
from being useless?

3020
01:27:13,320 --> 01:27:14,200
That's harsh.

3021
01:27:14,200 --> 01:27:15,320
He's allergic to over 200 things.

3022
01:27:15,320 --> 01:27:16,080
Pretty much everything.

3023
01:27:16,080 --> 01:27:17,680
Beef, lamb, chicken, shrimp...

3024
01:27:17,680 --> 01:27:18,960
He can't eat any of it.

3025
01:27:18,960 --> 01:27:19,880
He can only take medicine.

3026
01:27:19,880 --> 01:27:20,520
What's this?

3027
01:27:21,880 --> 01:27:23,920
Is this the fifth major tragedy?

3028
01:27:23,920 --> 01:27:25,560
Every one of us

3029
01:27:25,560 --> 01:27:27,360
has faced darkness we couldn't escape.

3030
01:27:27,360 --> 01:27:28,760
(Parallel mysteries, a repeating trap)

3031
01:27:28,760 --> 01:27:29,560
A trap within a trap.

3032
01:27:29,560 --> 01:27:30,400
A trap he set himself.

3033
01:27:30,400 --> 01:27:31,800
He wants to trap all seven of us

3034
01:27:31,800 --> 01:27:32,440
inside this game forever.

3035
01:27:32,440 --> 01:27:32,960
Yes.

3036
01:27:32,960 --> 01:27:33,760
Now we know the motive.

3037
01:27:33,760 --> 01:27:34,920
Of the five of us,

3038
01:27:34,920 --> 01:27:36,800
one person kept their memories.

3039
01:27:36,800 --> 01:27:39,000
We have to kill
this so-called plagiarist,

3040
01:27:39,000 --> 01:27:40,360
this thief.

3041
01:27:40,360 --> 01:27:41,200
He logged off.

3042
01:27:41,200 --> 01:27:42,800
The game's logout button

3043
01:27:43,280 --> 01:27:44,160
was

3044
01:27:44,160 --> 01:27:46,120
removed by one of you.

3045
01:27:46,120 --> 01:27:47,520
One of us?

3046
01:27:47,520 --> 01:27:49,280
One of you wants to keep everyone

3047
01:27:49,280 --> 01:27:51,480
trapped in the world
of Door of Truth forever.

3048
01:27:51,480 --> 01:27:53,280
No, you've got it all wrong!

3049
01:27:53,280 --> 01:27:53,880
Right.

3050
01:27:53,880 --> 01:27:55,760
Our killer did it to protect us.

3051
01:27:55,760 --> 01:27:56,400
To protect the crew.

3052
01:27:57,880 --> 01:27:59,200
It seemed so obvious.

3053
01:27:59,200 --> 01:27:59,840
What did?

3054
01:27:59,840 --> 01:28:00,720
Who do you think it is?

3055
01:28:00,720 --> 01:28:03,280
Insert Loading's name tag to open it.

3056
01:28:03,280 --> 01:28:04,400
Let's choose together.

3057
01:28:04,960 --> 01:28:05,800
We only get one chance.

3058
01:28:05,800 --> 01:28:06,800
Li Fei's suspicious too.

3059
01:28:06,800 --> 01:28:08,280
My memories only start today.

3060
01:28:08,280 --> 01:28:09,600
You can't just stay silent.

3061
01:28:09,600 --> 01:28:10,800
His grandma's death must've

3062
01:28:10,800 --> 01:28:12,680
hit him really hard.

3063
01:28:12,680 --> 01:28:13,600
I don't think so.

3064
01:28:13,600 --> 01:28:15,280
Wasn't there anything else
strange at home?

3065
01:28:15,280 --> 01:28:16,920
Why was everything covered
in safety padding?

3066
01:28:16,920 --> 01:28:18,520
When did I go blind?

3067
01:28:18,520 --> 01:28:19,960
I took this photo.

3068
01:28:19,960 --> 01:28:21,320
It's not a computer screenshot.

3069
01:28:21,320 --> 01:28:22,480
That doesn't really prove anything.

3070
01:28:22,480 --> 01:28:23,760
So Ning deliberately

3071
01:28:23,760 --> 01:28:25,080
revealed his location.

3072
01:28:25,080 --> 01:28:26,360
You wanted them to find you.

3073
01:28:26,360 --> 01:28:27,000
It's obvious.

3074
01:28:27,000 --> 01:28:28,320
That eliminates two people.

3075
01:28:28,520 --> 01:28:29,200
It's down to two.

3076
01:28:29,200 --> 01:28:29,800
Right now,

3077
01:28:29,800 --> 01:28:30,960
we have to vote for the killer.

